<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston on water service cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Boston on water service cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said analyst Michael Hoffman started coverage of three water treatment and purification companies, all with buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Newly-rated companies are Culligan Water Technologies Inc, Ionics Inc and U.S. Filter Corp.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Culligan shares were unchanged at 38-1/2, Ionics fell 1/4 to 52-1/8 and U.S. Filter rose one to 38.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
